  "body": "PRIVATE SALE BY OWNER - DOUBLE WESTLAKE ZONE (FORREST HILL) \r\n\r\nLooking for an affordable, high value entry into Auckland’s most desirable school zones? This sunny, beautifully positioned 2 bedroom end unit at 3/220 East Coast Road is the ultimate opportunity for young families, first home buyers, or downsizers looking for peace, safety, and top tier education.\r\n\r\nTHE UNBEATABLE SCHOOL ZONES:\r\n• Fully zoned for Westlake Boys High School & Westlake Girls High School.\r\n• In zone for Campbells Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Takapuna Normal Intermediate (TNIS), and Wairau Intermediate. \r\n• Minutes from Centennial Park, local cafes, public transport, motorway access, and Milford / Castor Bay beaches.\r\n\r\nTHE PROPERTY HIGHLIGHTS:\r\n• Safe & Secure: Positioned down a private driveway (one of three units), so completely quiet and secure for young children or pets away from main road traffic.\r\n• Sun Drenched Living: A bright north facing, comfortable lounge that catches all day sun, featuring a wall mounted heat pump for year round comfort.\r\n• Modern Kitchen: A clean, U-shaped kitchen layout complete with a stylish breakfast bar opening up to the living space with catches the afternoon sun and sunset.\r\n• Indoor/Outdoor Flow: French doors open from the lounge onto a sunny patio and low maintenance grass lawn (perfect for summer BBQs and outdoor living). \r\n• Separate Garage & Parking: Features its own separate, standalone single lock-up garage plus additional off street driveway parking right outside.\r\n• Bonus Storage: Includes a large, secure garden shed tucked away in the backyard (perfect for extra tools and garden equipment).\r\n• Bedrooms: 1 spacious master double bedroom with wardrobe which catches the morning sun, and second single sized bedroom ideal for kids or an office. \r\n• Space around back for a trampoline, additional storage shed or sleepout should you wish to expand.\r\n\r\nPRICE & PRIVATE SALE ADVANTAGE:\r\n• Buy Directly From Me: I am selling my property privately! Skip the stressful auctions and real estate agent premiums for a direct and transparent transaction.\r\n\r\nMessage me directly via email for my phone number to discuss this further and ask any questions.",
